#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:92
msgid "Hook Topics"
msgstr "钩子主题"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:2 4bc96b67381045b3bca22b5cfc87b170
msgid "Post-processing Tool Outputs"
msgstr "后处理工具输出"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:4 4468b4e62b034ad8adb1127020ebdf3d
msgid "**Intelligent output processing for ToolUniverse**"
msgstr "**ToolUniverse 的智能输出处理**"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:6 57eb93ce59534708b79ee75a742bfae0
msgid ""
"The ToolUniverse Hooks system provides automatic post-processing of tool "
"outputs. Use hooks to summarize long results, save large outputs to "
"files, and customize behavior per tool or workflow."
msgstr ""
"ToolUniverse Hooks 系统提供对工具输出的自动后处理功能。使用 Hooks "
"可对长结果进行摘要，将大量输出保存到文件中，并根据具体工具或工作流程自定义行为。"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:9 71155a49b280443196faec3dac4d0925
msgid "What are Hooks?"
msgstr "什么是钩子（Hooks）？"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:11 d523287df8d94947b62614ac3acaea3c
msgid ""
"Hooks are post-processing functions that automatically transform tool "
"outputs before they're returned to you. They're designed to:"
msgstr "Hooks 是一种后处理函数，可在工具输出返回给您之前自动对其进行转换。它们的设计目的包括："

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:13 df77349433b74417876e2ed8c8ee0e4e
msgid ""
"**Summarize long outputs**: Use AI to condense lengthy results into key "
"insights"
msgstr "**总结长输出**：使用人工智能将冗长的结果浓缩为关键洞察"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:14 6a01a176330f459d8e88eaf45e97e1c6
msgid "**Save large datasets**: Store massive outputs as files with metadata"
msgstr "**保存大型数据集**：将大量输出作为带有元数据的文件存储"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:15 f607169230fe42f88c2bd3f08e81c996
msgid ""
"**Customize processing**: Apply different logic based on tool type or "
"output size"
msgstr "**自定义处理**：根据工具类型或输出尺寸应用不同的逻辑"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:16 b63c2296b6e84f6a98f69fe626caba69
msgid "**Improve performance**: Reduce memory usage and processing time"
msgstr "**提升性能**：减少内存使用和处理时间"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:19 65ae0a45490b48cf980edcccabf55390
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速入门"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:21 d5079d0dd6174e57ae819f50cc1e5efc
msgid "**Enable hooks with one line:**"
msgstr "**通过一行代码启用钩子：**"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:37 45420f62a4b34bb4bb09fa4cc9429d91
msgid "**Choose different hook types:**"
msgstr "**选择不同的钩子类型：**"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:48 05e00ce2453d428ca4c9d9f341551fd1
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hook Types"
msgstr "钩子主题"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:50 ed8bf03a44b9486c977387cfc1facd90
msgid "**SummarizationHook** - AI-powered summarization"
msgstr "**SummarizationHook** - 基于AI的摘要功能"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:51 e3d4e68ed3d3483091297a6212000e9b
msgid ""
"Automatically summarizes long tool outputs using advanced AI models. "
"Preserves key findings while reducing length."
msgstr "自动使用先进的人工智能模型对冗长的工具输出进行总结，在缩短长度的同时保留关键结果。"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:53 93b7718149ba4d15bd4a19251c61e18a
msgid "**FileSaveHook** - File-based processing"
msgstr "**FileSaveHook** - 基于文件的处理"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:54 19acec83daf9402bb0bc5428facff128
msgid ""
"Saves large outputs to disk with metadata. Returns file information "
"instead of the original output."
msgstr "将大型输出保存到磁盘并附加元数据。返回文件信息而非原始输出。"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:56 1e3219e4a81e4684871f297c229a8782
msgid "**Custom Hooks** - User-defined processing"
msgstr "**自定义钩子** - 用户定义的处理"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:57 5247a15411a944bba3934f35f03b0672
msgid "Create your own hooks for specialized processing needs."
msgstr "创建您自己的钩子以满足特殊处理需求。"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:60 84cfb61fd7c34de7a228c632240e4740
msgid "When to Use Hooks"
msgstr "何时使用钩子"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:62 86d7d37abb244831b5b7a9672e3079ad
msgid ""
"**Use SummarizationHook when:** - Tool outputs are too long to read "
"efficiently - You need quick insights from detailed data - Working with "
"literature search results - Processing large scientific datasets"
msgstr ""
"**使用 SummarizationHook 的场景：**  \n"
"- 工具输出内容过长，难以高效阅读  \n"
"- 需要从详细数据中快速获取洞察  \n"
"- 处理文献搜索结果  \n"
"- 处理大型科学数据集"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:68 035cf3fcb37346d8bfd4f241cc257341
msgid ""
"**Note:** Some tools (like Tool_RAG, ToolFinderEmbedding) are "
"automatically excluded from hook processing to prevent information "
"missing. You can customize excluded tools using the `exclude_tools` "
"configuration option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:70 ee05f4978ee54673bb134d96c87416cf
msgid ""
"**Use FileSaveHook when:** - Outputs exceed memory limits - You need to "
"process outputs as files - Archiving results for later analysis - "
"Integrating with external tools"
msgstr ""
"**使用 FileSaveHook 的场景：**  \n"
"- 输出超出内存限制  \n"
"- 需要将输出作为文件进行处理  \n"
"- 归档结果以供后续分析  \n"
"- 与外部工具集成"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:76 dcd7be58b6af4b41a2b40d5ceb7fc0ac
msgid ""
"**Use Custom Hooks when:** - You have specific processing requirements - "
"Standard hooks don't meet your needs - You need specialized data "
"transformations"
msgstr ""
"**使用自定义钩子（Custom Hooks）的场景：**  \n"
"- 您有特定的处理需求  \n"
"- 标准钩子无法满足您的需求  \n"
"- 您需要进行专门的数据转换"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:82 98c47ab76bc84b5b8b8f8b04fbbd810b
msgid "Performance Impact"
msgstr "性能影响"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:84 c165869c47ff407aa9c59a30252fbe39
msgid "Hooks add processing overhead but provide significant benefits:"
msgstr "钩子会增加处理开销，但能带来显著的优势："

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:86 0bf6409949a14c8d86c838f9afc62c41
#, python-format
msgid "**SummarizationHook**: 2-5x processing time, 50-80% output reduction"
msgstr "**SummarizationHook**：处理时间增加2-5倍，输出减少50-80%"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:87 e928312d978d4aed937eed9538e123b1
msgid "**FileSaveHook**: Minimal overhead, significant memory savings"
msgstr "**FileSaveHook**：极低的开销，显著的内存节省"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:88 62a101f3d93d4af1b3ac793fc52a408a
msgid "**Custom Hooks**: Depends on implementation"
msgstr "**自定义钩子**：取决于实现"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:90 b184b93f12ee4f528e5a0627c8d77fc2
msgid ""
"The trade-off is usually worth it for large outputs that benefit from "
"processing."
msgstr "权衡通常是值得的，尤其是对于从处理过程中获益的大规模输出。"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:102 2d2eaeda9129487b8e1f9256eed91025
msgid "**Topic summaries**"
msgstr "**主题摘要**"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:104 1e219d68bd6544799e82595daa7be2c6
msgid ""
":doc:`summarization_hook`: Automatically condenses long tool outputs into"
" concise, high-signal summaries. Useful for literature results, large "
"datasets, and multi-step workflows."
msgstr ":doc:`summarization_hook`：自动将冗长的工具输出浓缩为简洁且高效的信息摘要。适用于文献结果、大型数据集及多步骤工作流程。"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:105 89b73b0281924cbc97b54e5cf7386b6d
msgid ""
":doc:`file_save_hook`: Saves large outputs to disk with metadata for "
"later processing and sharing. Ideal for heavy payloads, audit trails, and"
" external pipelines."
msgstr ":doc:`file_save_hook`：将大型输出及其元数据保存到磁盘，以便后续处理和共享。适用于大容量数据、审计追踪和外部管道。"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:106 ac517025b20c44bf85033b17ef9cb3b1
msgid ""
":doc:`hook_configuration`: Configure which hooks run, when they trigger, "
"and how they behave. Supports thresholds, per-tool rules, and advanced "
"options."
msgstr ":doc:`hook_configuration`：配置钩子的运行时机、触发条件及行为方式。支持阈值设置、按工具规则及高级选项。"

#: ../../guide/hooks/index.rst:107 96fbf8e06d134723874380f841eb459b
msgid ""
":doc:`server_stdio_hooks`: How to use hooks in server (HTTP/SSE) and "
"stdio modes. Covers CLI flags, Python API, defaults, and best practices."
msgstr ""
":doc:`server_stdio_hooks`：如何在服务器（HTTP/SSE）和标准输入输出模式中使用钩子。涵盖命令行参数、Python "
"API、默认设置及最佳实践。"

